{
  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-data-versioning.\n\n- Provides lightweight versioning for spatial (vector) data using snapshot + change detection.\n- Supports commit (write version snapshot), diff (compare versions by key, show changes), and log (list version history) operations.\n- Outputs snapshots (GeoJSON), version logs, diff reports, and manifests.\n- Supports both real vector data (via --input) and offline synthetic workflows (--synthetic).\n- All processing is local and offline by default; no external network required.\n- Includes clear CLI usage examples and dependency list.",
